From 973c007a66808a95aa43567d4590b4197a5fed26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Werner Stein <werner.stein@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:20:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(cli): inspect agent topic push forge controls

Expose the existing read-only inspector so operators can identify missing
forge enforcement before using agent topic push. Keep unknown identity and
denial evidence explicit without enabling pushes or changing admission.

Refs: #538
Co-Authored-By: Codex gpt-6.1-sol <noreply@openai.com>
---
